  "description": "Universal Hubs whose logic lives in a Shiny.AppDeviceBridge web app: the app serves them over BLE, Wi-Fi and Multipeer on its own server, and every call reaches the web app — so a hub's behavior ships with a web app update. The web app also joins other devices' hubs, by name. One call: bridge.AddHubsBridge(server => …).",
